  "controls": [
    "Six separate-process discovery permutations and four native mode orders; both cold readers accept source-only certificates. Verification, preparation, loading, persistence and cold reconstruction are charged.",
    "Resume saves 29.01% complete time and 6078 probes only with the first round already acquired. Constructing one round then resuming costs 0.78903s versus 0.72224s uninterrupted restart; historical acquisition and compaction are additional.",
    "The original and first strengthened bank remain flat failed-literal fixed points. The second round finds nine failed sides; final compaction retains seven and a 21-step joint contradiction, preserving the two first-level lemmas.",
    "Full and compact chains produce identical native graphs at the original shortcut budget. Compact reconstruction takes 3.01690s; a larger shared ceiling reduces this to 1.04320s but remains 10.94% slower than fresh at 0.94034s. Fresh is the selected measured native workflow; all regressions and archives remain.",
    "The feedback rule alone stalls on the UNSAT four-variable formula containing all sixteen assignment-excluding clauses. This is a rule-completeness counterexample, not failure of the entire portfolio or a complexity lower bound.",
