  "pattern": "Repeatedly collect failed-side implications from bounded conditioning of the preceding exact augmented bank. Reuse a checked prefix and search only the new level. Final-level causal compaction preserves all earlier banks.",
  "recognition": "Bind canonical seeds, ordering and each signed branch certificate. Recheck the entire prefix on resume and warm native hits. Refuted prefixes need no search; saved no-new-units rounds are rechecked because larger bounds can find new information. Cross-level proof references decrease level and local references decrease stage; memo identities include branch environments.",
